    mc "...Ugh"
    "I've grown so numb that the incessive alarm can't even make me budge."
    "Why even wake up? What's the point?"
    scene bg bedroom
    with fade
    "I stare at the ceiling while laying in my bed as my phone's alarm blares."
    stop sound
    "After a while I turn towards it to turn off the alarm, revealing my home screen with the latest notification."
    "I'm sorry we couldn't make this work..."
    #[a phone screen image that's interactable. Contents will be discussed]
    "Elsea..."
    "Two years of my life. Gone like that."
    "Knowing the cesspool of gossip at my school is, chances are everyone will know by first period."
    "I do NOT want to deal with that."
    "While truancy is sounding quite tempting with my current lack of motivation, I'd rather not have my parents on my ass for my adult life."
    "I stumble out of bed and throw on my uniform straight from the hamper, barely passing the sniff test."
    
    scene bg school
    with fade
    "I never noticed how many couples there really were before today."
    "Or how annoying they are with their blatant affection towards each other."
    "Was I ever that sickening?"
    "At least they mind their business, unlike some of the others."
    "It's only been two days since the break-up, but I can already hear the whispers and feel the glares."
    "Just a walking attraction for the high and mighty to point and laugh at."
    "It doesn't matter anymore."
    "Nothing matters."
    
    scene bg class_day
    with fade
    "This day has been nothing but a drag."
    "I look at the clock and see there's still 30 minutes left of class."
    "I can't wait to get out of here."
    "Away from the looks, the whispers, the couples that serve as a reminder..."
    "I put my face in my hands and just pray that I'm ignored until the final bell."
    "Wait..."
    "The art club"
    "I can't stay there anymore."
    "Elsea was the only reason I joined. Plus, my projects were always the worst in the group."
    "..."
    "They will probably write me off if I just don't go. I don't need to say anything"
    "Plus, I don't want to run into a chance of bumping into her."
    "*RIIIINGGGG*" # [Insert Bell Ringing sound bit]
    "Finally, it's all over. I can go home."
    "But.."
    "I don't move."
    "I don't know if it's my lack of motivation or my social anxiety, but I refused to even lift my head until I was sure everyone was out of the class."
    "The only one left is the teacher as they finish packing up their briefcase."
    a "[player], your little nap is over. Maybe you should head home and get some rest so you can stay awake in tomorrow's class"
    mc "sigh Yes, sir."
    
    scene bg school_hall_1
    with dissolve
    "I wasn't in a rush to leave yet, but I was able to wait long enough to at least let the halls clear."
    "Only the occasional groups of people making plans or heading to clubs are up and about."
    "They look distracted enough not to see me, so I should be good."
    st1 "Oh my god! That's so pathetic!"
    "My eyes immediately shoot to the commotion just down the hall as I turn the corner"
    
    scene bg lockers
    with wipeleft
    "I freeze in place momentarily and see a group of other students surrounding a pink haired girl."
    "The taller of the students is holding a book over her head as she tries to jump for it unsuccessfully."
    show natsuki turned vang ml e4c at t11
    qu "Give it back you friggin jerks!!"
    show natsuki cm e2d b1e
    st2 "Aww! The cute little baby wants her picture book. What, are regular books too hard?"
    show natsuki mm
    "The small girl grumbles as she swings at one of the students, but they dodge her and push her on the ground near where I'm standing."
    show natsuki b1b e1g
    "She looks up to me with tears beginning to well with a grimace on her face."
    "I look at her and then the group of students. I know two of them are in Elsea's homeroom"
    "I quickly look away and begin to walk away."
    show natsuki at thide
    hide natsuki
    "It's not like I can actually do anything."
    "Besides.."
    "If they're busy with her, they'll ignore me."
    scene bg living_room_afternoon
    with fade
    "It's finally over.."
    "For now at least."
    "I walk in and drop my bag and blazer at the front of the door."
    "I haven't eaten anything today, so I should probably get something"
    "Everything I see in the kitchen takes too much energy to try and make."
    "I don't even have an appetite for anything, but I know I need to eat something."
    "While grabbing my phone to try and get a link for delivery, the memories just flash back."
    scene bg kitchen_memory
    with dissolve
    e "Hey sweatie! Have you eaten today?"
    mc "Nah. I wasn't really feeling like it"
    e "You know you need to eat. I can make you something if you want. What do you feel like?"
    mc "Anything from you is good enough for me."
    e "*giggle* I'm sure it is. Fine. Let me take care of you."
    mc "You always do"
    scene bg living_room_afternoon
    with dissolve
    "..."
    "I really am pathetic. I can't even feed myself."
    "God, how did Elsea even stomach me? Let alone be so territorial?"
    "A somber smirk creeps on the left side of my mouth as I recall how jealous she would get when any girl was around me."
    "It's not like THAT will happen anytime soon"
    "I turn my phone off and grab a spoon and a jar of peanut butter."
    "At least it's something."
    "I plop on the couch and just turn on an anime I've seen a dozen times and nod off."
    scene bg black
    with fade

    return